{"availability":"available","full":"sreehithacyber07/DocMatch-plus","name":"DocMatch-plus","description":"Body-first patient assessment prototype with adaptive safety screening, specialty direction, and structured clinical handoff.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T17:35:59Z","updated":"2026-10-05T12:28:06Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://docmatch-plus.vercel.app","topics":["accessibility","clinical-decision-support","healthcare","patient-intake","postgresql","react","research-prototype","supabase","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://docmatch-plus.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.323Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.323Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.323Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:09.323Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Where symptoms begin, care finds its direction.","DocMatch+ is a body-first patient assessment prototype. It helps a person describe a concern, asks relevant follow-up questions, checks defined warning signs, and prepares a specialty direction with a structured handoff for clinical review. It provides a specialty direction, not a diagnosis.","Explore the live prototype → · Research / engineering prototype"],"features":["Body-first selection with semantic body and face regions, patient-relative laterality, and keyboard-accessible controls.","Adaptive questioning based on prior answers, with the response trail kept visible.","Parallel urgent-review and hard-stop safety presentation.","A guarded General Medicine or Paediatrics fallback when a narrower direction is not supported.","A structured SOAP-style handoff that distinguishes patient report, captured context, routing assessment, and next step."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sreehithacyber07/DocMatch-plus/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4d9d836c45fc362982391584f0e702791826873f2de6a57e67fd